void clampCard(Card* c){RECT r;GetWindowRect(c->hwnd,&r);RECT a=workArea(c->hwnd);int x=std::clamp((int)r.left,(int)a.left,std::max((int)a.left,(int)(a.right-(r.right-r.left))));int y=std::clamp((int)r.top,(int)a.top,std::max((int)a.top,(int)(a.bottom-(r.bottom-r.top))));SetWindowPos(c->hwnd,nullptr,x,y,0,0,SWP_NOZORDER|SWP_NOSIZE|SWP_NOACTIVATE);}
